  "intro": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Iriel left Valenwood with a bow, a pouch of seeds she will never eat, and a grudge against anyone who fells a tree. This is a Bosmer archer for Naaktiid: she opens every fight from the dark with a poisoned arrow and is gone before the second one lands. Marksman, Sneak and Alchemy carry her; Evasion and Wayfarer keep her moving; Jephre keeps her honest. No magic, no heavy armour, no plants on the plate.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "overview": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Levels 1 to 10: the hide years",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Start at the Eldergleam and walk out with the Hunting Light Bow. Put your first trainer sessions into Marksman at level 4; the bow is the whole build until Sneak catches up. Keep two kinds of poison on you at all times:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Paralysis for anything that hits hard",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Frostbite for anything that runs",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Swap to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "mention",
       "attrs": {
        "id": "Requiem.esp:ABF9F7",
        "kind": "item",
        "label": "Imperial Bow"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": " at level 6 and Steel Arrows. Do not bother with a sword yet.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "horizontalRule"
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Levels 11 to 30",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "From 11 on, Sneak does the work and the bow finishes it. Take Lone Wolf at 12 and never hire anyone: Solo at 27 is the payoff. Two rules that matter more than any perk:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "start": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Never shoot twice from the same spot.",
           "type": "text",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "bold"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "text": " Fog of War buys you one step; use it.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Jephre wants you on foot.",
           "type": "text",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "italic"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "text": " Wayfarer and Wind Walker exist so you can outrun what you could not kill.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Endgame kit is the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "mention",
       "attrs": {
        "id": "Skyrim.esm:0139A5",
        "kind": "item",
        "label": "Glass Light Bow"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": " with Glass Arrows and the Elven Hunter set, then a Glass Cuirass at 30. The Silver Garnet Ring from 18 stays on for good. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "mention",
       "attrs": {
        "id": "Wayfarer:Lone Wolf",
        "kind": "perk"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": " is the perk to plan around.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}